{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L1RoZSUyMENha2VtYWtlciUyMCUyODIwMTclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Cakemaker","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/WwHLnuqqwhvCkBACCMAR5xuQMA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7e87cbZoiPYwAqWjLppd7Blx3Ir.jpg","description":"Thomas, a young German baker, is having an affair with Oren, an Israeli married man who has frequent business visits in Berlin. When Oren dies in a car crash in Israel, Thomas travels to Jerusalem seeking for answers regarding his death. Under a fabricated identity, Thomas infiltrates the life of Anat, his lover’s newly widowed wife, who owns a small Café in downtown Jerusalem. Thomas starts to work for her, creating German cakes and cookies that bring her Café to life. Thomas finds himself involved in Anat’s life in a way far beyond his anticipation. To protect the truth he will stretch his lie to a point of no return.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"113 min","cast":["Tim Kalkhof","Sarah Adler","Roi Miller","Zohar Shtrauss","Sandra Sade","Tamir Ben Yehuda","Stephanie Stremler","Tagel Eliyahu"],"director":["Ofir Raul Graizer"],"released":"2017-12-28T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tim Kalkhof","character":"Thomas","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vM5Hvcro7qqB2iuqJaojJUeks85.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Adler","character":"Anat","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tjrZBdtW9FceKIvzYOQBd3pCeAv.jpg"},{"name":"Roi Miller","character":"Oren Nachmias","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/leZJFPF44BTl8eBXhyYEHMP8zd1.jpg"},{"name":"Zohar Shtrauss","character":"Moti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x1fDHFt1lg3NGisHsnsocgCEIJg.jpg"},{"name":"Sandra Sade","character":"Hanna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9lvmsVKZnpXJxludxnNclOMdLVe.jpg"},{"name":"Tamir Ben Yehuda","character":"Itai Nachmias"},{"name":"Stephanie Stremler","character":"Sophia","photo":"https:/